{
  "name": "HSC-04 - Stalled Opportunities Follow-up Summary [Dev]",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "sticky-readme-4",
      "name": "README",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-700, -320],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 460,
        "height": 340,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## HSC-04 - Stalled Opportunities Follow-up Summary [Dev]\n\n**Owned By:** Ronny Kalaksanan\n**Last Updated:** 2026-08-23\n\n**Description:**\nBagian dari Layer 3 (Segmentation). Mengambil semua contact di active list 'Stalled Opportunities' HubSpot, lalu minta Groq membuat ringkasan follow-up yang actionable untuk tim Alurio.\n\n**Flow:**\n1. TriggerManualTest\n2. SetListId - listId = 13 (Stalled Opportunities)\n3. GetListMembers - GET memberships list dari HubSpot\n4. ExtractRecordIds - ambil array ID contact dari hasil membership\n5. HasMembers - cek ada member atau tidak\n6. GetContactDetails - ambil detail contact (email, nama, lifecycle) via Search API\n7. FormatContactList - susun jadi teks list\n8. GenerateFollowUpSummary - Groq bikin ringkasan actionable\n9. LogSummary / LogSyncError\n\n**Dependencies:**\n- Credential: \"HubSpot Private App Token\" (scope: crm.lists.read, crm.objects.contacts.read)\n- Credential: \"Groq API Key\"\n- List ID Stalled Opportunities: 13 | New Leads This Week: 12"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "trigger-manual-4",
      "name": "TriggerManualTest",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-700, 40],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "set-listid",
      "name": "SetListId",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [-460, 40],
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Ganti listId ke 12 kalau mau jalanin buat 'New Leads This Week' sebagai gantinya.",
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "s1", "name": "listId", "type": "string", "value": "13" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "http-get-members",
      "name": "GetListMembers",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [-220, 40],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 1000,
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "=https://api.hubapi.com/crm/v3/lists/{{ $json.listId }}/memberships/join-order",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [{ "name": "limit", "value": "100" }]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "HubSpot Private App Token"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "code-extract-ids",
      "name": "ExtractRecordIds",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [20, 40],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const body = $input.first().json;\nconst results = body.results || [];\nconst recordIds = results.map(r => String(r.recordId));\n\nreturn [{ json: { recordIds, count: recordIds.length } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "if-has-members",
      "name": "HasMembers",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [260, 40],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "loose" },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.count }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": { "type": "number", "operation": "gt" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "noop-no-members",
      "name": "NoStalledOpportunities",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [500, 200],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "http-get-contacts",
      "name": "GetContactDetails",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [500, -60],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 1000,
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.hubapi.com/crm/v3/objects/contacts/search",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { \"filterGroups\": [ { \"filters\": [ { \"propertyName\": \"hs_object_id\", \"operator\": \"IN\", \"values\": $json.recordIds } ] } ], \"properties\": [\"email\", \"firstname\", \"lastname\", \"lifecyclestage\"], \"limit\": 100 } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "HubSpot Private App Token"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "code-format-list",
      "name": "FormatContactList",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [740, -60],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const body = $input.first().json;\nconst results = body.results || [];\n\nconst lines = results.map(c => {\n  const p = c.properties || {};\n  return `- ${p.firstname || ''} ${p.lastname || ''} (${p.email || 'no email'})`;\n}).join('\\n');\n\nreturn [{ json: { contactListText: lines || 'Tidak ada detail contact ditemukan.', count: results.length } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "http-groq-4",
      "name": "GenerateFollowUpSummary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [980, -60],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 1000,
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.groq.com/openai/v1/chat/completions",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { \"model\": \"openai/gpt-oss-20b\", \"messages\": [ { \"role\": \"system\", \"content\": \"Kamu asisten sales ops Alurio yang membuat ringkasan singkat dan actionable soal opportunity yang butuh follow-up, bahasa Indonesia, maksimal 3-4 kalimat.\" }, { \"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Berikut daftar contact yang masuk segment Stalled Opportunities:\\n\" + $json.contactListText } ] } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Groq API Key"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "set-log-summary",
      "name": "LogSummary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [1220, -160],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "l1", "name": "status", "type": "string", "value": "summary_generated" },
            { "id": "l2", "name": "summary", "type": "string", "value": "={{ $json.choices?.[0]?.message?.content || '' }}" },
            { "id": "l3", "name": "generatedAt", "type": "string", "value": "={{ $now.toISO() }}" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "set-log-error-4",
      "name": "LogSyncError",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [740, 160],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "e1", "name": "status", "type": "string", "value": "failed" },
            { "id": "e2", "name": "error", "type": "string", "value": "={{ $json.error?.message || 'Unknown error' }}" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
